From a396cb209af89ae5769a5cbfd5e31de6439b81e8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ultras <stavultras@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 13:28:23 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] hw/arm/mt7981: SPI-NOR boot flash

flash=nor puts a SPI-NOR chip (spinor.c: 3-byte addressing, JEDEC ID
nor-id, 1-1-1/1-1-2/1-1-4/1-2-2/1-4-4 reads, page program, sector/block/
chip erase, status registers) on SPI2 CS0; the BootROM emulation loads
BL2 from its "SF_BOOT" header + GFH. Same backing store as SPI-NAND
(folder of partition dumps or a raw image).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
